OL,3,GNEWSATown's 347-year-old clock to chime
OL,4,Aagain
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Humphries, the town's mayor,
OL,7,Fsaid: "[The clock is] a fundamental
OL,8,Fpart of our history... we have the
OL,9,Fresponsibility to restore that heritage
OL,10,Fand bring that back."
